There's one that stands out because there is no name

796
00:36:24,640 --> 00:36:28,800
but it appears still that whatever the activity was

797
00:36:28,800 --> 00:36:30,800
has been completed at this desk.

798
00:36:30,800 --> 00:36:33,080
There's an open empty box

799
00:36:33,080 --> 00:36:36,080
with a single folded card in front of it.

800
00:36:36,079 --> 00:36:38,079
Got it, got it, got it, got it, got it, got it.

801
00:36:38,079 --> 00:36:41,960
Your hand unhooks from the string

802
00:36:41,960 --> 00:36:43,519
that's kind of holding it up there

803
00:36:43,519 --> 00:36:45,960
and you pull it down and pop the top off

804
00:36:45,960 --> 00:36:49,679
and pull out a note inside.

805
00:36:51,199 --> 00:36:53,679
And the note says,

806
00:36:53,679 --> 00:36:57,279
we all waved goodbye to the hall monitor today.

807
00:36:57,279 --> 00:36:58,239
She's having a hard time,

808
00:36:58,239 --> 00:37:02,880
not like just like, ugh, rolling, rolling her eyes.

809
00:37:02,880 --> 00:37:06,960
Like I worked so hard for that.

810
00:37:08,160 --> 00:37:10,360
Bon, when do you go for any one in particular

811
00:37:10,360 --> 00:37:11,200
of the names I listed?

812
00:37:11,200 --> 00:37:13,200
I'm gonna go the one that's open

813
00:37:13,200 --> 00:37:17,160
with the card in front of it and see what that says.

814
00:37:17,160 --> 00:37:18,320
Sure.

815
00:37:18,320 --> 00:37:21,960
You go again, the box is empty,

816
00:37:21,960 --> 00:37:25,400
it bears no name on it and this folded card,

817
00:37:25,400 --> 00:37:28,599
you open it up and it says,

818
00:37:28,599 --> 00:37:31,400
some memories are still being written.

